# Knob extremes on a kick, a snare and a bell, then P1 and P2 swept fast (both ends in two steps) during a
# sixteenth-note pattern over every key family: no clicks, nothing stuck, every hit ends.
tempo 120
steps 64
tail 4.0
track perc
param p1 0 0
param p2 0 0
note 0 F3 1 127
param p1 255 4
param p2 255 4
note 4 F3 1 127
param p1 0 8
param p2 255 8
note 8 A3 1 127
param p1 255 12
param p2 0 12
note 12 Db5 1 127
sweep p1 0 255 16 18
sweep p2 255 0 16 18
sweep p1 255 0 18 20
sweep p2 0 255 18 20
sweep p1 0 255 20 22
sweep p2 255 0 20 22
sweep p1 255 0 22 24
sweep p2 0 255 22 24
note 16 F3 1 127
note 17 Db4 1 100
note 18 A3 1 120
note 19 Db4 1 100
note 20 Db5 1 110
note 21 Eb4 1 100
note 22 Ab4 1 127
note 23 E5 1 100
sweep p1 0 255 24 32
sweep p2 0 255 24 32
note 24 F4 1 127
note 26 Bb4 1 127
note 28 Eb5 1 127
note 30 E4 1 127
param p1 128 40
param p2 128 40
note 40 Db5 1 127
expect sound 0 44
expect idle 120
expect peak_below 0
